From 64c33de1640f692cd9b30f83f479247b3b81e8e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 00:33:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(app): keep the current page on refresh

Only go() wrote the URL hash, and on boot the app overwrote it with #home,
so refreshing on a restaurant, results, booking or profile page sent the
user back to the home page. One effect now mirrors every route change to
the hash + history + sessionStorage; back/forward replace instead of push;
#profile waits for the auth check before redirecting.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVBL5iZYYYyZbpCNmiD6Bq
